# The companion desktop app's source, dependencies, and build output never
# need to be part of the deployed site. Without this, `vercel --prod` was
# trying to upload companion/'s own Electron binaries (173MB+ each), blowing
# past Vercel's 100MB per-file limit even though git itself already ignores
# them.
companion/
# The installer itself is also over that same 100MB limit -- distributed via
# a GitHub Release asset instead (see companion/README.md), never served
# from this site directly.
public/RaidLead-Companion-Setup.exe
